{"id":"60e50068702b03cb","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-relative-category.md","title":"柱集内的相对稠密、开集与稀疏性","display":"df-relative-category — 柱集内的相对稠密、开集与稀疏性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-relative-category","aliases":["20-df-relative-category"],"display":"df-relative-category — 柱集内的相对稠密、开集与稀疏性","chapter":"14","section":"14.1.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 14.1.1 的子空间展开","source_printed_pages":[211,212],"source_pdf_pages":[240,241],"depends_on":["[[20-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-relative-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-relative-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-category — 柱集内的相对稠密、开集与稀疏性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 14.1.1 的子空间展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>240</span><span>241</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=[\\sigma]\">\\(S=[\\sigma]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,U\\subseteq S\">\\(B,U\\subseteq S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative-category}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{RelOpen}_S(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists V\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Open}(V)\\land U=S\\cap V],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RelDense}_S(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow U\\cap[\\tau]\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Meager}_S(B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(S)^\\omega\\\n[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\operatorname{RelOpen}_S(U_n)\\land\\operatorname{RelDense}_S(U_n))\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega} U_n\\subseteq S\\setminus B].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative-category}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{RelOpen}_S(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists V\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Open}(V)\\land U=S\\cap V],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RelDense}_S(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow U\\cap[\\tau]\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Meager}_S(B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(S)^\\omega\\\n[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\operatorname{RelOpen}_S(U_n)\\land\\operatorname{RelDense}_S(U_n))\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega} U_n\\subseteq S\\setminus B].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子空间使用诱导拓扑；稠密性只检查位于该柱内的基本邻域。结构参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 作为谓词下标保留，避免把局部 meager 和全 Cantor 空间 meager 混同。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 14.1.1 的子空间展开；印刷页 211, 212；PDF 第 240, 241 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S=[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"B,U\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative-category}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{RelOpen}_S(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists V\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Open}(V)\\land U=S\\cap V],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RelDense}_S(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow U\\cap[\\tau]\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Meager}_S(B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(S)^\\omega\\\n[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\operatorname{RelOpen}_S(U_n)\\land\\operatorname{RelDense}_S(U_n))\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega} U_n\\subseteq S\\setminus B].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1611,"backlinks":[{"id":"19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-relative-category]]；see [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-category]] — 章 14；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-category]]"}],"outgoing":["e3e4bc829c39df8c"]}